  "details": "VRChat SDK Version: 3.1.10\n\nDescription of the bug:\n\nPhysBones performance stats are incorrect after switching build target.\n\n\"Phys Bone Transform Count\" and \"Phys Bone Collision Check Count\" become 0.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n\n1. Set up PhysBones with PhysBoneColliders.\n\n2. Make sure PhysBone's transform count and collision check count are NOT 0 in SDK control panel.\n\n3. Switch build target to Android.\n\n4. PhysBone's transform count and collision check count become 0.\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\n\nAttached a screenshot.",
